{title: Build my Life}
{artist: Housefires}
{key: G}

{comment: Intro}
[G]   [C/G]   [G/B]    [C/G]

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]     Worthy of every [C/G]song we could ever sing
[G/B]     Worthy of all the [C/G]praise we could ever bring
[G]     Worthy of every [C/G]breath we could ever breathe
We live for [G/B]You     [C/G]

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]     Jesus, the Name [C/G]above every other name
[G/B]     Jesus, the only [C/G]One who could ever save
[G]     Worthy of every [C/G]breath we could ever breathe
We live for [G/B]You      Oh, we live for [C/G]You

{comment: Chorus}
[Cmaj9]Holy, there is no one [Am7]like You
There is none [G]beside You
Open up my [Em7]eyes in wonder
[Cmaj9]Show me who You are and [Am7]fill me
With Your heart and [G]lead me
In Your love to [Em7]those around me     [Cmaj9]

Interlude (2x):
[Cmaj9]   [Dsus]   [Em7]   [G/B]

{comment: Bridge}
[Cmaj9]I will build my [Dsus]life upon Your [Em7]love
It is a [G/B]firm foundation
[Cmaj9]I will put my [Dsus]trust in You [Em7]alone
And I will [G/B]not be shaken
